  "description": "Orchard Core module that stores and manages per-tenant Pendo integration settings\n      via Orchard Core's ISiteService. Provides an admin UI for configuring the Pendo\n      script snippet and enabling Pendo for front-end and admin areas.",
  "id": "GovBuilt.Pendo",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-05T17:45:57.46Z",
