  "published": "2026-11-05T17:42:14.46Z",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.3:\n      - Fixed: Pendo script settings, user, and tenant are resolved per request, so each tenant renders its own script and tenant name.\n      - Fixed: {{UserId}}, {{UserRoles}}, and {{TenantName}} are JavaScript-escaped to prevent broken or injected scripts.\n      - Added: {{UserRolesJson}} token that emits roles as a JSON array (use unquoted, e.g. role: {{UserRolesJson}}). {{UserRoles}} is unchanged.\n      - Updated: Admin settings hint and sample snippet document the new token.",
